# The character studio's sign-in and saving (Character-Studio.md C6): the same Supabase project, allowlist and session as
# the admin (`@no-origins/auth`). Copy to .env.local. With neither set, a development server opens without a login and
# saves nothing — CI's visual review, a laptop offline; production never opens.
#
# Local stack: `npx supabase start`, then `npx supabase status` prints both.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
